<title>PHILIPPINES: PCIBank declines comment on merger talks.</title>
<headline>PCIBank declines comment on merger talks.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine Commercial International Bank (PCIBank) declined comment on merger talks with Philippine Bank of Communications (PBCom) but said it was looking for a possible merger partner.</p>
<p>&quot;We are looking for opportunities (to merge) but no comment at this time. It's still too early,&quot; PCIBank president Rafael Buenaventura told reporters.</p>
<p>PBCom officials were unavailable for comment.</p>
</text>
